    "detailed_description": "Have you ever wonder what is it feel like to work in a food factory where you are forced to sort  healthy and unhealthy food? This game has got you covered.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-Growing difficulty: as the game go it will get faster and faster, you won't have time to react!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-BOOM!: Sometimes the bomb factory next door will send in some surprise during your work, don't let it send your foods flying!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-Action packed: as the game gets harder, you will feel like a ninja master throwing foods and tossing bombs!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-Keeps record: you can see your highest payout and highest level reached on the score board!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhat are you waiting for? Join the factory! For food sake!",
